{"content":[{"signature":"","thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"Now log masking. The cleanest chokepoint in caos's architecture is the container runner's `run_worker`: **all** worker output flows through its `log`, and everything downstream (container stderr → runnerd → server → client, and every `*.log`) derives from it. Scrubbing there — where the injected values are known — covers the whole chain at the source.","type":"text"},{"caller":{"type":"direct"},"id":"toolu_015CwRkvneCwrpXa34iv7PJR","input":{"file_path":"crates/caos/src/bin/caos.rs","limit":40,"offset":476},"name":"read","type":"tool_use"}],"results":[],"v":1}